pokeheartgold-zhostfix.patch (tools/pokehg_gen.py applies the patches in name order): the decomp's own mistakes the HGSS
runs found on the PC, one block per bug, most of them a struct read at its DS offsets or allocated with its DS size where
the host layout (8-byte pointers) differs. Made against the pin + every patch before it: when wideprotos.patch is remade,
leave this one out of the fresh tree, then check it still applies. Each block has its paragraph right above its
`diff --git`, ending in a `Handover-ID:` line (the decomp-side handover, or `none yet` with the bug when it is not handed
over); tools/hgss_repin.py drops a block with its paragraph when the pin has the fix. The dropped blocks (crashes 23-83,
hg17..hg38, hbs2, cut1): this file's git log and docs/hgss.md.

